### conversations.rest — Chat entre renter y owner por listing
### Módulo: src/conversations/conversations.controller.ts (ConversationsModule)
### Todas las rutas requieren JWT (no exige cuenta verificada: mensajear queda libre).
###
### Elegí entorno con "Switch Environment" (local/production). Ver REST_CLIENT.md.
### Mantenimiento: si cambia este endpoint, actualizá este archivo en el mismo
### cambio (ver CLAUDE.md).

### ── Setup: owner con listing ACTIVE + renter (ver auth.rest/listings.rest) ──

@ownerEmail = conv-owner-{{$timestamp}}@test.local
@renterEmail = conv-renter-{{$timestamp}}@test.local
@password = TestPass123!
@ownerCode = 000000
@renterCode = 000000

# @name ownerRegisterStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "email": "{{ownerEmail}}" }

### ⚠️ Copiá el código del owner de la consola del server antes de seguir.
# @name ownerRegisterComplete
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/complete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{ownerEmail}}",
  "code": "{{ownerCode}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "Carla",
  "lastName": "Owner",
  "acceptedTerms": true,
  "dateOfBirth": "1992-07-15"
}

@ownerToken = {{ownerRegisterComplete.response.body.$.accessToken}}

# @name renterRegisterStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "email": "{{renterEmail}}" }

### ⚠️ Copiá el código del renter de la consola del server antes de seguir.
# @name renterRegisterComplete
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/complete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{renterEmail}}",
  "code": "{{renterCode}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "Bruno",
  "lastName": "Renter",
  "acceptedTerms": true,
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-03-10"
}

@renterToken = {{renterRegisterComplete.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### El owner necesita cuenta VERIFIED para publicar (ver verification.rest).

# @name createVehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{ "brand": "Toyota", "model": "Corolla", "year": 2021, "category": "SEDAN" }

@vehicleId = {{createVehicle.response.body.$.id}}

# @name createListing
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "title": "Toyota Corolla 2021",
  "description": "Auto full equipo, service al día, ideal para viajes largos.",
  "pricePerDay": 15000,
  "locationText": "Av. Corrientes 1234, CABA",
  "latitude": -34.6037,
  "longitude": -58.3816,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

@listingId = {{createListing.response.body.$.id}}

### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. El renter crea (o reusa) la conversación con el owner del listing.
# @name startConversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversations
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

{
  "listingId": "{{listingId}}"
}

@conversationId = {{startConversation.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Lista las conversaciones propias (como renter u owner).
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/me
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

### 3. Obtiene una conversación (solo participantes).
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

### 4. El renter envía un mensaje de texto (type es opcional, default TEXT).
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

{
  "content": "Hola! ¿El auto está disponible para retirar el 10/9?",
  "type": "TEXT"
}

### 5. El owner responde con una nota de audio (URL ya subida a Cloudinary).
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "content": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/video/upload/v1/audio/sample.mp3",
  "type": "AUDIO"
}

### 6. Lista los mensajes de la conversación.
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

### 7. El renter marca como leídos los mensajes entrantes (los del owner).
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/conversations/{{conversationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}
